{"id":589,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"本物に触れる教養と探究を通じ自律自立をめざす","feature_description":"跡見学園は「本物に触れる」学びを大切にし、伝統文化や芸術、国際交流などの経験を教育に取り入れています。探究型の創造学習では、問いを見つけ、調べ、考えを表現する力を育成。6年間の教育課程と丁寧な学習指導を通して、自律し自立した女性を育てることを教育理念に掲げています。体験と探究の両面から社会に関わる力を育成します。探究活動を重視しています。","clubs":[{"id":14892,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14893,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14894,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14895,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14896,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14897,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14898,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14899,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14900,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14901,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14902,"name":"サッカー同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14903,"name":"陸上競技同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14904,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.atomi.ac.jp/jh/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14905,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","s